          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Notebook</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n<th>Leans on</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q1</strong></td>\n<td><code>01_dms_activity_map.py</code></td>\n<td>Which mutations improve activity, and where do they sit?</td>\n<td>DMS table (SI-002)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q2</strong></td>\n<td><code>02_structure_context.py</code></td>\n<td>Are the hits where the structure says they should be?</td>\n<td>DMS + PDB 7OG3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q3</strong></td>\n<td><code>03_knowledge_base.py</code></td>\n<td>What does prior work already know?</td>\n<td><code>kb/papers/*.md</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q4</strong></td>\n<td><code>04_structure_prediction.py</code></td>\n<td>What does prediction see that the crystal cannot?</td>\n<td>ESMFold + 7OG3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q5</strong></td>\n<td><code>05_additivity.py</code></td>\n<td>Doubles &amp; triples: additive or epistatic?</td>\n<td>SI-003 + site classes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Q6</strong></td>\n<td><code>06_masked_recovery.py</code></td>\n<td>If the DMS had a hole where the literature matters?</td>\n<td>everything</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
