            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-four-modalities\">The four modalities</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Modality</th>\n<th>Where</th>\n<th>What it is good at</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>DMS + ee data</strong></td>\n<td><code>data/raw/</code></td>\n<td><em>Discovery</em> -- finding hits nobody guessed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Crystal structure</strong></td>\n<td><code>data/external/7OG3.pdb</code></td>\n<td><em>Mechanism filtering</em> -- killing bad priors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Knowledge base</strong></td>\n<td><code>kb/</code></td>\n<td><em>Explanation &amp; recovery</em> -- naming what worked and why</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Structure prediction</strong></td>\n<td><code>data/external/ired88_esmfold.pdb</code></td>\n<td><em>Blind-spot extension</em> -- with a confidence score attached</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Helper code lives in <code>ired_88_research_copilot/</code> (<code>data.py</code>,\n<code>structure.py</code>, <code>kb.py</code>, <code>theme.py</code>), with tests in <code>tests/</code>.\nPresenting live? <code>notebooks/live/</code> holds empty skeleton twins of\nevery notebook.</span></span>"
